    "taggedHandles": [],
    "text": "4 Mitte bars, one for every kind of night 🍷 part 3 of my Berlin bars-by-area series — which area should I do next? #berlinbars #mitte #berlinnightlife #expatinberlin #berlintiktok bars in Berlin in mitte",
    "subtitles": "If this is the Berlin you want\nthese are the spots you should visit\nWelcome to my new series\nwhere I recommend you\nthe bars in every neighborhood in Berlin today midday\nFirst in the list we have Binarai Forum\nIf you want something cozy\nbut it's still fancy\nthis one is for you\nIt feels like a fancy living room\nLow lights, it's match furniture\nand a really cozy, almost French kind of vibe\nThen we have Market Prince\nIf you want something\na little bit more heating and vintage\nthis one is for you. It's less polished\na little bit more rusty\nand has that old school Berlin feeling\nPlus the outside is really nice\nif you are walking around and want to just stop for a drink\nThen we have 100 G\nThis one I expected to be a little bit more mainstream\nbut actually it's not\nIt's a little bit dark\nwith low fee jazz ish vibes\nand they also have events\nso it's a great pre going out spot\nThen we have clerics I think\nIf you want something random\nand that's why I left it at the end\nthis one is for you. I literally\nI don't know how to describe it\nbecause they have summer vibes inside the club\nthe disco ball, but\nalso restaurant and cafe\nso it's pretty much everything\nSo if you don't have a plan\nto where do you wanna go\nbut you actually want to go outside\nthis One is for you. And that's it\nThat's my day\nA little bit fancy\na little bit cozy, a little bit random\nI definitely have way more recommendations in media\nbecause usually where I hang out\nbut I'm trying to diversify\nBut check it out in the other videos\nThanks for watching\nBye. Bye",
